==Icelandic==

===Interjection===
'''hæ'''

# [[hi]]

====Usage notes====

The use of ''[[hæ]]'' and ''[[bæ]]'' (corresponding to English "hi" and "bye", respectively) is often frowned upon, especially among older people. ''[[sæll]]/[[sæl]]'' and ''[[bless]]'' should be used instead.

